                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Got into this after a recommendation from a group of Solo Boardgamers. While I am terrible at this game, I'm really enjoying it! The campaign story doesn't seem to be that intriguing, but is challenging nonetheless.\n\nAlright, just to balance these reviews from people who can't read and just jump on everything that says free to play. As the Steam page very much tells you:\n\nF2P: Play vs AI, short campaign.\nB2P: Play online, play vs AI with difficulty options, longer campaign.\n\nThat having been said, it's a fun deck-building game with nice sci-fi art, played lots of it on Android and on PC pre-Steam. And if it interests you (and you're not just here because you saw \"free to play\") then definitely give it a try.\n\nThe game is quickly learned and sessions can either be done very quick, or over the course of a longer period by playing with 48 hour turns. There are online leaderboards where your progression is stored and as you go up in rank you earn more avatars -- everything else in the game remains the same so you are only held back by your skill.\nThe free game already comes with singleplayer campaign that functions like a tutorial, but the full game adds online multiplayer, as well as additional campaign levels and increases the AI battles to three difficulty settings.\nOn top of that there are currently three expansions that change the game in various ways. By signing up for a Star Realms username you keep access to any expansions (including the full game) on all platforms if you buy them here, likewise if you already have any of the expansions you can easily restore them to the Steam version and keep playing.\n\nIf you like strategic card games, Star Realms is a really great entry. Give it a try and maybe we'll meet in multiplayer :)\n\n매우 매우 잘 만든 덱 빌딩 게임으로 모든 플랫폼에서 결제정보를 공유한다. (자체 로그인 시스템)\n사실 스팀으로 플레이하는것 보다 모바일 디바이스가 더 적합하다고 느껴진다.\n게임은 매우 빠르게 진행되고 룰도 간단한 편이다. 하지만 다양한 카드로 인해서 재미가 증가한다.\nDLC 가 매우 많아서 좀 거부감이 있긴하지만 하루 이틀만에 뚝딱 나온게 아니라 몇년에 걸쳐서 하나씩 하나씩 추가하는 중.\n스팀 플레이타임은 거의 없지만 폰으로는 몇십시간 넘게 플레이한듯...\n",
